-- `rule foo?` sugar (TODO.md's "Rules: optional/enable sugar"): an
-- implicit, rising-edge-triggered enable port sharing the rule's own
-- name. `step` here is BOTH the port an external testbench drives and
-- the rule that fires once per external pulse -- held high across
-- multiple cycles, including straight through reset, still fires only
-- once, on the 0->1 transition (sim/optional_rule_tb.v exercises exactly
-- this: held high through reset, held high with no new edge, a real
-- edge, held high again, a second real edge).
module OptionalRule {
    out count : [4] = 0

    rule step? {
        count := count + 1
    }
}
